廬陵王友、秘書丞。明帝詔求異士，始安王遙光表薦暕及東海王僧孺曰：「臣聞求賢暫勞，垂拱永逸，方之疏壤，取類導川。伏惟陛下道隱旒纊，信充符璽，白駒空谷，振鷺在庭；猶懼隱鱗卜祝，藏器屠保，物色關下，委裘河上。非取制於一狐，諒求味於兼采。而五聲倦響，九工是詢；寢議廟堂，借聽輿皁。臣位任隆重，義兼邦家，實欲使名實不違，僥倖路絕。勢門上品，猶當格以清談；英俊下僚，不可限以位貌。竊見秘書丞琅邪王暕，年二十一，七葉重光，海內冠冕，神清氣茂，允迪中和。叔寶理遣之談，彥輔名教之樂，故以暉映先達，領袖後進。居無塵雜，家有賜書；辭賦清新，屬言玄遠；室邇人曠，物疏道親。養素丘園，台階虛位；庠序公朝，萬夫傾首。豈徒荀令可想，李公不亡而已哉！乃東序之秘寶，瑚璉之茂器。」除驃騎從事中郎。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0000","surface":"王暕","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0003","surface":"思晦","start":3,"end":5,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0013","surface":"儉","start":13,"end":14,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0025","surface":"暕","start":25,"end":26,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:u0048","surface":"賓客","start":48,"end":50,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"群體未逐名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0054","surface":"暕","start":54,"end":55,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0127","surface":"遙光","start":127,"end":129,"person_id":"98q_mll_d6v_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangjian-sons-context:p002:m0131","surface":"暕","start":131,"end":132,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府